## 6. Create Materialized View
```sql
CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW students_by_email AS
  SELECT * FROM students
  WHERE email IS NOT NULL AND id IS NOT NULL AND createdAt IS NOT NULL
  PRIMARY KEY (email, id, createdAt);
```

